{"act_id": "IND_state_20557", "chunk_id": "IND_state_20557_s052_p1", "title": "The Prison Act, 1894", "chapter": "XI", "section_number": "52", "section_title": "The Prison Act, 1894", "text": "Act: The Prison Act, 1894 (Act 9 of 1894) | India | State | In Force\nChapter XI: ** | Section 52: Procedure on committal of heinous offence\n\n_**Act of going on hunger strike is an offence under Section 52 of Prison Act.-**_ In the interest of maintaining discipline in jails, the refusal to take food by a prisoner has been made an offence. [ _Lakshmi Narain v. State, 1959 Cri Lj 283 at 284 : AIR 1959 All 164 (DB)_ ]", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "prohibitory", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['general']", "has_proviso": true, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": [], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1894.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/20557?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_20557/act.pdf"}
