{"act_id": "IND_state_19015", "chunk_id": "IND_state_19015_s065_p1", "title": "The rights of persons with disabilities act, 2016", "chapter": "XI", "section_number": "65", "section_title": "The rights of persons with disabilities act, 2016", "text": "Act: The rights of persons with disabilities act, 2016 (Act 49 of 2016) | India | State | In Force\nChapter XI: CENTRAL AND STATE ADVISORY BOARDS ON DISABILITY AND DISTRICT LEVEL COMMITTEE | Section 65: Functions of Central Advisory Board on disability.** —( _1_ ) Subject to the provisions of this Act,\n\n( _f_ ) monitor and evaluate the impact of laws, policies and programmes to achieve full participation of persons with disabilities; and\n\n( _g_ ) such other functions as may be assigned from time to time by the Central Government.", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "mandatory", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['general']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": [], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 2016.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/19015?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_19015/act.pdf"}
{"act_id": "IND_state_19313", "chunk_id": "IND_state_19313_s051", "title": "The Indian Forest Act 1927", "chapter": "VIII", "section_number": "51", "section_title": "The Indian Forest Act 1927", "text": "Act: The Indian Forest Act 1927 (Act 16 of 1927) | India | State | In Force\nChapter VIII: OF THE COLLECTION OF DRIFT AND STRANDED TIMBER | Section 51: Power to make rules and prescribe penalties.** —( _1_ ) The State Government[1] [may, by notification in the Official Gazette, make rules] to regulate the following matters, namely:—\n\n**51. Power to make rules and prescribe penalties.** —( _1_ ) The State Government[1] [may, by notification in the Official Gazette, make rules] to regulate the following matters, namely:—\n\n( _a_ ) the salving, collection and disposal of all timber mentioned in section 45;\n\n( _b_ ) the use and registration of boats used in salving and collecting timber;\n\n( _c_ ) the amounts to be paid for salving, collecting, moving, storing or disposing of such timber; and\n\n( _d_ ) the use and registration of hammers and other instruments to be used for marking such timber.\n\n> 2[( _1A_ ) Every rule made by the State Government under this Act shall be laid, as soon as may be after it is made, before the State Legislature.]\n\n( _2_ ) The[3] [State Government] may prescribe, as penalties for the contravention of any rules made under this section, imprisonment for a term which may extend to six months, or fine which may extend to five hundred rupees, or both.", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "mandatory", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['environmental_law']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": "rules", "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": [], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1927.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/19313?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_19313/act.pdf"}
