{"act_id": "IND_state_19318", "chunk_id": "IND_state_19318_s144", "title": "The Motor Vehicle Act, 1939", "chapter": "X", "section_number": "144", "section_title": "The Motor Vehicle Act, 1939", "text": "Act: The Motor Vehicle Act, 1939 (Act 4 of 1939) | India | State | In Force\nChapter X: ** | Section 144: Overriding effect.** - The provisions of this Chapter shall have effect notwithstanding anything contained in any other provision of this Act or of any other law for the time being in force\n\n**144. Overriding effect.** - The provisions of this Chapter shall have effect notwithstanding anything contained in any other provision of this Act or of any other law for the time being in force.\n\n_**Corresponding Law.**_ - Section 144 corresponds to section 92 - E of the Motor Vehicles Act, 1939.\n\n_**Objects and Reasons.**_ - Clause 144 provides for overriding effect of this Chapter over any other provisions of this Act or any law for the time being in force.", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "overriding", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['general']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": true, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": ["Motor Vehicles Act, 1939"], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1939.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/19318?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_19318/act.pdf"}
{"act_id": "IND_state_18989", "chunk_id": "IND_state_18989_s091", "title": "The andaman and nicobar islands land revenue and reforms regulation 1966", "chapter": "VIII", "section_number": "91", "section_title": "The andaman and nicobar islands land revenue and reforms regulation 1966", "text": "Act: The andaman and nicobar islands land revenue and reforms regulation 1966 (Act 2 of 1966) | India | State | In Force\nChapter VIII: LAND RECORDS** | Section 91: Every entry in the land records existing at the commencement of this Regulation and every entry made\n\n91. Every entry in the land records existing at the commencement of this Regulation and every entry made therein under this Chapter shall be presumed to be correct until the contrary is proved or a new entry is lawfully substituted therefor.", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "mandatory", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['tax_law', 'property_law']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": [], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1966.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/18989?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_18989/act.pdf"}
