{"act_id": "IND_state_18989", "chunk_id": "IND_state_18989_s131", "title": "The andaman and nicobar islands land revenue and reforms regulation 1966", "chapter": "XI", "section_number": "131", "section_title": "The andaman and nicobar islands land revenue and reforms regulation 1966", "text": "Act: The andaman and nicobar islands land revenue and reforms regulation 1966 (Act 2 of 1966) | India | State | In Force\nChapter XI: REALISATION OF LAND REVENUE** | Section 131: Every person who may have become a surety under any grant or license made or granted under this Regu\n\n131. Every person who may have become a surety under any grant or license made or granted under this Regulation whereunder the sum secured is recoverable from the principal as an arrear of land revenue shall, in failure to pay the amount or any portion thereof which he may have become liable to pay under the terms of his security bond, be liable to be proceeded against under the provisions of this Regulation in the same manner as for the recovery of arrears of land revenue\n\n## **CHAPTER X11 VILLAGE OFFICER** _**A-Chaudhari**_", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "mandatory", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['tax_law', 'property_law']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": [], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1966.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/18989?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_18989/act.pdf"}
