{"act_id": "IND_state_18982", "chunk_id": "IND_state_18982_s056_2", "title": "The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Cooperative Socities Regulation 1973", "chapter": "VIII", "section_number": "56", "section_title": "The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Cooperative Socities Regulation 1973", "text": "Act: The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Cooperative Socities Regulation 1973 (Act 3 of 1973) | India | State | In Force\nChapter VIII: ** | Section 56(2): _**Reference of disputes to arbitration**_ :- (1) The Registrar may, on receipt of\n\n(2) For the purposes of the sub-section (1), the following shall be deemed to include disputes touching the constitution, management or the business of a cooperative society, namely:-\n\n- (a) a claim by the society for any debt or demand due to it from a member, past member, or the nominee, heir or legal representative of a deceased member, whether such debt or demand be admitted or not;\n\n- (b) a claim by a surety against the principal debtor where the society has recovered from the surety any amount in respect of any debt or demand due to it from the principal debtor as a result of the default of the principal debtor, whether such debt or demand is admitted or not;\n\n- (c) any dispute arising in connection with the election of any officer of the society.", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "prohibitory", "section_type": "sub_section", "legal_subject": "['property_law']", "has_proviso": true, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": [], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1973.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/18982?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/