{"act_id": "IND_state_18982", "chunk_id": "IND_state_18982_s012_4_d3", "title": "The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Cooperative Socities Regulation 1973", "chapter": "II", "section_number": "12", "section_title": "The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Cooperative Socities Regulation 1973", "text": "Act: The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Cooperative Socities Regulation 1973 (Act 3 of 1973) | India | State | In Force\nChapter II: ** | Section 12(4): Registration of Amendment** :- On receipt of an application for registration, together with other do\n\n(4) After the expiry of the period specified in the notice in appendix 'C' and after considering the reply, if any, of the co-operative society and the views, if any, of the credit agency on such reply, the Registrar may, after duly considering the objection of the society (if any) to the proposed amendment, register the amendment.", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "mandatory", "section_type": "sub_section", "legal_subject": "['property_law']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": [], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1973.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/18982?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_18982/act.pdf"}
{"act_id": "IND_state_19012", "chunk_id": "IND_state_19012_s032_p0", "title": "The real estate (regulation and development) act, 2016", "chapter": "V", "section_number": "32", "section_title": "The real estate (regulation and development) act, 2016", "text": "Act: The real estate (regulation and development) act, 2016 (Act 17 of 2016) | India | State | In Force\nChapter V: THE REAL ESTATE REGULATORY AUTHORITY | Section 32: Functions of Authority for promotion of real estate sector**\n\n**32. Functions of Authority for promotion of real estate sector** .—The Authority shall in order to facilitate the growth and promotion of a healthy, transparent, efficient and competitive real estate sector make recommendations to the appropriate Government or the competent authority, as the case may be, on,—\n\n( _a_ ) protection of interest of the allottees, promoter and real estate agent;\n\n( _b_ ) creation of a single window system for ensuring time bound project approvals and clearances for timely completion of the project;\n\n( _c_ ) creation of a transparent and robust grievance redressal mechanism against acts of omission and commission of competent authorities and their officials;\n\n( _d_ ) measures to encourage investment in the real estate sector including measures to increase financial assistance to affordable housing segment;\n\n( _e_ ) measures to encourage construction of environmentally sustainable and affordable housing, promoting standardisation and use of appropriate construction materials, fixtures, fittings and construction techniques;\n\n> 1. Subs. by the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Removal of Difficulties Order, 2016 [S.O. 3347 (E)], for \"specified by regulations\" (w.e.f. 28-10-2016).\n\n( _f_ ) measures to encourage grading of projects on various parameters of development including grading of promoters;", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "mandatory", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['general']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": [], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 2016.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/19012?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_19012/act.pdf"}
{"act_id": "IND_state_18982", "chunk_id": "IND_state_18982_s008_d1", "title": "The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Cooperative Socities Regulation 1973", "chapter": "X", "section_number": "8", "section_title": "The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Cooperative Socities Regulation 1973", "text": "Act: The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Cooperative Socities Regulation 1973 (Act 3 of 1973) | India | State | In Force\nChapter X: ** | Section 8: _**Death of Candidate**_ :- If an intimation of death of a candidate is received - If an intimation of death of a candidate is received\n\n8. _**Death of Candidate**_ :- If an intimation of death of a candidate is received - If an intimation of death of a candidate is received", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "general", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['property_law']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": [], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1973.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/18982?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_18982/act.pdf"}
{"act_id": "IND_state_19012", "chunk_id": "IND_state_19012_s056", "title": "The real estate (regulation and development) act, 2016", "chapter": "VII", "section_number": "56", "section_title": "The real estate (regulation and development) act, 2016", "text": "Act: The real estate (regulation and development) act, 2016 (Act 17 of 2016) | India | State | In Force\nChapter VII: THE REAL ESTATE APPELLATE TRIBUNAL | Section 56: Right to legal representation**\n\n**56. Right to legal representation** .—The applicant or appellant may either appear in person or authorise one or more chartered accountants or company secretaries or cost accountants or legal practitioners or any of its officers to present his or its case before the Appellate Tribunal or the Regulatory Authority or the adjudicating officer, as the case may be.\n\n_Explanation_ .—For the purposes of this section,—\n\n( _a_ ) \"chartered accountant\" means a chartered accountant as defined in clause ( _b_ ) of sub-section ( _1_ ) of section 2 of the Chartered Accountants Act, 1949 (38 of 1949) or any other law for the time being in force and who has obtained a certificate of practice under sub-section ( _1_ ) of section 6 of that Act;\n\n( _b_ ) \"company secretary\" means a company secretary as defined in clause ( _c_ ) of sub-section ( _1_ ) of section 2 of the Company Secretaries Act, 1980 (56 of 1980) or any other law for the time being in force and who has obtained a certificate of practice under sub-section ( _1_ ) of section 6 of that Act;\n\n( _c_ ) \"cost accountant\" means a cost accountant as defined in clause ( _b_ ) of sub-section ( _1_ ) of section 2 of the Cost and Works Accountants Act, 1959 (23 of 1959) or any other law for the time\n\nbeing in force and who has obtained a certificate of practice under sub-section ( _1_ ) of section 6 of that Act;\n\n( _d_ ) \"legal practitioner\" means an advocate, vakil or an attorney of any High Court, and includes a pleader in practice.", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "discretionary", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['general']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": ["Chartered Accountants Act, 1949", "Company Secretaries Act, 1980", "Works Accountants Act, 1959"], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 2016.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/19012?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_19012/act.pdf"}
