{"act_id": "IND_state_19010", "chunk_id": "IND_state_19010_s003_p0_d1", "title": "The payment of wages act, 1936", "chapter": "", "section_number": "3", "section_title": "The payment of wages act, 1936", "text": "Act: The payment of wages act, 1936 (Act 4 of 1936) | India | State | In Force\nSection 3: _Explanation_ renumbered as _Explanation_ I thereof by Act 68 of 1957, s. 5 (w.e.f. 1-4-1958)\n\n> 3. _Explanation_ renumbered as _Explanation_ I thereof by Act 68 of 1957, s. 5 (w.e.f. 1-4-1958).\n\n> 4. Ins. by s. 5, _ibid._ (w.e.f. 1-4-1958).\n\n> 5. Subs. by Act 41 of 2005, s. 3, for \"the State Government\" (w.e.f. 9-11-2005).\n\n> 6. Subs. by Act 68 of 1957, s. 5, for clause ( _d_ ) (w.e.f. 1-4-1958).\n\n> 7. The words \"Governor-General in Council or\" omitted by the A.O. 1937.\n\n> 8. Ins. by Act 53 of 1964, s. 6 (w.e.f. 1-2-1965).\n\n> 9. Subs. by Act 56 of 1974, s. 3 and the Second Schedule, for \"this sub-clause\" (w.e.f. 20-12-1974).\n\n> 1[( _f_ ) deductions for recovery of advances of whatever nature (including advances for travelling allowance or conveyance allowance), and the interest due in respect thereof, or for adjustment of over-payments of wages;\n\n( _ff_ ) deductions for recovery of loans made from any fund constituted for the welfare of labour in accordance with the rules approved by[2] [appropriate Government], and the interest due in respect thereof;\n\n( _fff_ ) deductions for recovery of loans granted for house-building or other purposes approved by 2[appropriate Government] and the interest due in respect thereof;]\n\n( _g_ ) deductions of income-tax payable by the employed person;\n\n( _h_ ) deductions required to be made by order of a Court or other authority competent to make such order;", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "discretionary", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['labour_law']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": ["Provident Funds Act, 1925", "Life Insurance Corporation Act, 1956", "Trade Union Act, 1926", "Trade Unions Act, 1926"], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1936.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/19010?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_19010/act.pdf"}
{"act_id": "IND_state_19318", "chunk_id": "IND_state_19318_s021_4", "title": "The Motor Vehicle Act, 1939", "chapter": "II", "section_number": "21", "section_title": "The Motor Vehicle Act, 1939", "text": "Act: The Motor Vehicle Act, 1939 (Act 4 of 1939) | India | State | In Force\nChapter II: ** | Section 21(4): Suspension of driving licence in certain cases .** - (1) Where, in relation to a person who had been\n\n(4) If a driving licence in relation to a particular class or description of motor vehicles is suspended under sub-section (1), the person holding such licence shall be debarred from holding or obtaining any licence to drive such particular class or description of motor vehicles so long as the suspension of the driving licence remains in force.\n\n_**Corresponding Law.**_ - Section 21 corresponds to section 17-A of the Motor Vehicles Act, 1939.\n\n_**Objects and Reasons.**_ - Clause 21 provides for automatic suspension of the driving licence of the person who has caused the death of or grievous hurt to one or more persons, for a period of 6 months or until the person is discharged or acquitted by the Court, whichever is earlier.", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "mandatory", "section_type": "sub_section", "legal_subject": "['general']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": ["Motor Vehicles Act, 1939"], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1939.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/19318?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_19318/act.pdf"}
