{"act_id": "IND_state_18999", "chunk_id": "IND_state_18999_s019_p0", "title": "The factories act, 1948", "chapter": "III", "section_number": "19", "section_title": "The factories act, 1948", "text": "Act: The factories act, 1948 (Act 63 of 1948) | India | State | In Force\nChapter III: ``` | Section 19: Latrines and urinals. (1) In every factory--\n\n19. Latrines and urinals. (1) In every factory--\n```\n\n- `(a) sufficient latrine and urinal accommodation of prescribed types shall be provided conveniently situated and accessible to workers at all times while they at the factory;`\n\n- `(b) separate enclosed accommodation shall be provided for male and female workers;`\n\n- `(c) such accommodation shall be adequately lighted and ventilated, and no latrine or urinal shall, unless specially exempted in writing by the Chief Inspector, communicate with any workroom except through an intervening open space or ventilated passage;`\n\n```\n(d) all such accommodation shall be maintained in a clean\nand sanitary condition at all times;\n```\n\n- `(e) sweepers shall be employed whose primary duty it would be to keep clean latrines, urinals and washing places.`\n\n```", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "mandatory", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['general']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": [], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 1, "year": 1948.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/18999?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_18999/act.pdf"}
{"act_id": "IND_state_18982", "chunk_id": "IND_state_18982_s078", "title": "The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Cooperative Socities Regulation 1973", "chapter": "XIII", "section_number": "78", "section_title": "The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Cooperative Socities Regulation 1973", "text": "Act: The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Cooperative Socities Regulation 1973 (Act 3 of 1973) | India | State | In Force\nChapter XIII: MISCELLANEOUS** | Section 78: _**Power to exempt co-operative societies from provisions of the Regulation**_ :- The Chief Commissi\n\n78. _**Power to exempt co-operative societies from provisions of the Regulation**_ :- The Chief Commissioner may, by general or special order, exempt any co-operative society or any class of co-operative societies from any of the provisions of this Regulation or may direct that such provision shall apply to such societies or class of societies with such modifications as may be specified in the order if he is satisfied that such exemption or direction is necessary having regard the nature of the activities of the society or class of societies or that such exemption or direction is necessary in the public interest or in the interest of the co-operative movement.\n\n**ANDAMAN & NICOBAR GAZETTTE, EXTRAORDINARY, MAY 13, 1973**\n\n**35**", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "mandatory", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['property_law']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": [], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1973.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/18982?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_18982/act.pdf"}
{"act_id": "IND_state_19015", "chunk_id": "IND_state_19015_s100_p0", "title": "The rights of persons with disabilities act, 2016", "chapter": "XVII", "section_number": "100", "section_title": "The rights of persons with disabilities act, 2016", "text": "Act: The rights of persons with disabilities act, 2016 (Act 49 of 2016) | India | State | In Force\nChapter XVII: ## MISCELLANEOUS | Section 100: Power of Central Government to make rules.** —( _1_ ) The Central Government may, subject to the con\n\n**100. Power of Central Government to make rules.** —( _1_ ) The Central Government may, subject to the condition of previous publication, by notification, make rules for carrying out the provisions of this Act.\n\n( _2_ ) In particular, and without prejudice to the generality of the foregoing power, such rules may provide for all or any of the following matters, namely:—\n\n( _a_ ) the manner of constituting the Committee for Research on Disability under sub-section ( _2_ ) of section 6;\n\n( _b_ ) the manner of notifying the equal opportunity policy under sub-section ( _1_ ) of section 21; ( _c_ ) the form and manner of maintaining records by every establishment under sub-section ( _1_ ) of section 22;\n\n( _d_ ) the manner of maintenance of register of complaints by grievance redressal officer under sub-section ( _3_ ) of section 23;\n\n( _e_ ) the manner of furnishing information and return by establishment to the Special Employment Exchange under section 36;\n\n( _f_ ) the composition of the Assessment Board under sub-section ( _2_ ) and manner of assessment to be made by the Assessment Board under sub-section ( _3_ ) of section 38;\n\n( _g_ ) rules for person with disabilities laying down the standards of accessibility under section 40;\n\n( _h_ ) the manner of application for issuance of certificate of disability under sub-section ( _1_ ) and form of certificate of disability under sub-section ( _2_ ) of section 58;", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "mandatory", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['general']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": [], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 2016.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/19015?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_19015/act.pdf"}
{"act_id": "IND_state_18982", "chunk_id": "IND_state_18982_s057_2", "title": "The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Cooperative Socities Regulation 1973", "chapter": "IX", "section_number": "57", "section_title": "The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Cooperative Socities Regulation 1973", "text": "Act: The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Cooperative Socities Regulation 1973 (Act 3 of 1973) | India | State | In Force\nChapter IX: ** | Section 57(2): _**Winding up of co-operative societies**_ :- (1) If the Registrar, after an inquiry\n\n(2) The Registrar may of his own motion make an order directing the winding\n\nup of a co-operative society-\n\n- (a) where it is a condition of the registration of a society that the society shall consist of at least ten members and the number of members has been reduced to less than ten; or\n\n- (b) where the society has not commenced working or has ceased to function in accordance with co-operative principles.", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "overriding", "section_type": "sub_section", "legal_subject": "['property_law']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": true, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": [], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1973.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/18982?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_18982/act.pdf"}
