{"act_id": "IND_state_18982", "chunk_id": "IND_state_18982_s076_10", "title": "The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Cooperative Socities Regulation 1973", "chapter": "IX", "section_number": "76", "section_title": "The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Cooperative Socities Regulation 1973", "text": "Act: The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Cooperative Socities Regulation 1973 (Act 3 of 1973) | India | State | In Force\nChapter IX: ** | Section 76(10): Procedure in execution of awards etc\n\n(10) The immovable property shall not be sold in execution of a decree; unless such property has been previously attached;\n\nProvided that the decree has been obtained on the basis of a mortgage of such property, it shall not be necessary to attach it.", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "prohibitory", "section_type": "sub_section", "legal_subject": "['property_law']", "has_proviso": true, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": [], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1973.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/18982?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_18982/act.pdf"}
{"act_id": "IND_state_19318", "chunk_id": "IND_state_19318_s096_p7", "title": "The Motor Vehicle Act, 1939", "chapter": "II", "section_number": "96", "section_title": "The Motor Vehicle Act, 1939", "text": "Act: The Motor Vehicle Act, 1939 (Act 4 of 1939) | India | State | In Force\nChapter II: ** | Section 96: Power of State Government to make rules for the purposes of this**\n\n**Chapter\n\n*S. 5 of the T.N. Motor Vehicles ( Special Provisions ) Act, 1992 provides that the provisions of Ss. 3, 4 and 6 of the 1992 Act shall have effect notwithstanding anything inconsistent therewith contained in Chaps. V and VI including S. 98 of the Motor Vehicles Act, 1998.", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "overriding", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['general']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": true, "delegation_type": "rules", "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": ["Motor Vehicles Act, 1998"], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1939.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/19318?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_19318/act.pdf"}
