{"act_id": "IND_state_19318", "chunk_id": "IND_state_19318_s164_p1", "title": "The Motor Vehicle Act, 1939", "chapter": "XI", "section_number": "164", "section_title": "The Motor Vehicle Act, 1939", "text": "Act: The Motor Vehicle Act, 1939 (Act 4 of 1939) | India | State | In Force\nChapter XI: ** | Section 164: Power of Central Government to make rules. -** (1) The Central Government may make rules for the pur\n\n(j) any other matter which is to be, or may be, prescribed. _**Corresponding Law.**_ - Section 164 corresponds to section 111 of the Motor Vehicles Act, 1939.\n\n_**Objects and Reasons.**_ - Clause 164 confers upon the Central Government the power to frame rules to implement the provisions of clause 60.", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "discretionary", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['general']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": "rules", "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": ["Motor Vehicles Act, 1939"], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1939.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/19318?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_19318/act.pdf"}
