{"act_id": "IND_state_19012", "chunk_id": "IND_state_19012_s074", "title": "The real estate (regulation and development) act, 2016", "chapter": "IX", "section_number": "74", "section_title": "The real estate (regulation and development) act, 2016", "text": "Act: The real estate (regulation and development) act, 2016 (Act 17 of 2016) | India | State | In Force\nChapter IX: FINANCE, ACCOUNTS, AUDITS AND REPORTS | Section 74: Grants and loans by State Government**\n\n**74. Grants and loans by State Government** .—The State Government may, after due appropriation made by State Legislature by law in this behalf, make to the Authority, grants and loans of such sums of money as the State Government may think fit for being utilised for the purposes of this Act.", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "discretionary", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['general']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": [], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 2016.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/19012?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_19012/act.pdf"}
{"act_id": "IND_state_18982", "chunk_id": "IND_state_18982_s075_d1", "title": "The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Cooperative Socities Regulation 1973", "chapter": "IX", "section_number": "75", "section_title": "The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Cooperative Socities Regulation 1973", "text": "Act: The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Cooperative Socities Regulation 1973 (Act 3 of 1973) | India | State | In Force\nChapter IX: ** | Section 75: Manner of service of notice** :- A notice under the provision to section 62\n\n## **CHAPTER IX**\n\n## **EXECUTION OF AWARDS, DECREES, ORDERS AND DECISIONS**\n\n**75. Manner of service of notice** :- A notice under the provision to section 62\n\nshall indicate the substance of the demand or debt due to the co-operative society and shall be served in the manner laid down for the service of summons in subrule (3) of rule 78. No order under section 62 shall be made until a period of thirty days has expired from the date of service of the notice.", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "mandatory", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['property_law']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": [], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1973.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/18982?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_18982/act.pdf"}
